# Data Formatting

## formats

Below data formatts with thousand separator
```
"#,0,,.0M"  -- Million
"#,0,.0K",   -- Thousand
"#,0", -- Single
```

## formatting based on value of lowest recognized child category

```
Area label = 
  var __min_entity = MINX(FILTER(ALL(Schemes[Type]),Schemes[Type]<> "TBC"),[Area])
  var __r =
         SWITCH (
              TRUE(),
              __min_entity <200000, "#,0,.0K",   -- Thousand
              __min_entity >=200000, "#,0,,.0M"  -- Million
          )
  var __ty = FORMAT([Area],__r)
  RETURN
  SELECTEDVALUE(Schemes[Type])&" "&
  __ty & " (" & ROUND([Area (type share)]*100,0)&"%)"
```
